  "description": "On a fresh table-type recordset over F with Index PK_F for each comparison argument [=> ;; =< ;; != ;; <=> ;;  =  ;; >=  ;; \"\" ;; Like ;; EQ ;; ~ ;; Null ;; Empty ;; Missing ;; Long 0 ;; Long 61 ;; Boolean True]: Seek with that argument and the key Long 4, read NoMatch, BOF, EOF and ID. Asks which operator spellings and argument types the method accepts and which row each selects. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
